<urn:atm:triage:finding/DEBUG-ASSERT-REDUNDANT-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "DEBUG-ASSERT-REDUNDANT-001" ;
  triage:title "redundant debug_assert! in apply_display_mutations_to_store strictly subsumed by following debug_assert_eq!" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent (RBP-F003 on AD.32) reports a redundant debug_assert! in apply_display_mutations_to_store strictly subsumed by the following debug_assert_eq! (same line region flagged by arch-qa's ARCH-001/ARCH-002, i.e. crates/atm-core/src/read/mod.rs around lines 796-797). This finding overlaps the same code region as PEEK-MUTATION-001 and ACKMODE-DEAD-PARAM-001 and should be fixed in the same pass as those." ;
